      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right that a strong social framework requires more \"hard power\" in virtue.\n\n**Strong personal responsibility and rigorous critical thinking (discipline in thought, not just in feeling) are necessary to avoid partisan dependency and political narcissism in the digital age.\n\nFurthermore, a commitment to the *process* of the democracy, rather than just the outcome, is the necessary \"loyalty\" to the system that allows for change and debate.",
